OL,3,GNEWSALorry sheds its load leading to M4
OL,4,Adelays
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are being warned of delays on a
OL,7,Fstretch of the M4 after a lorry shed
OL,8,Fits load.
OL,10,FIt happened on the motorway westbound
OL,11,Fbetween junction 13 for Chieveley and
OL,12,Fjunction 14 for the Hungerford
OL,13,FInterchange.
OL,15,FNational Highways said the load and a
OL,16,Fspillage across the motorway lanes was
OL,17,Fbeing cleared.
OL,19,FTwo lanes are closed with drivers are
OL,20,Fbeing warned to allow extra time for
OL,21,Ftheir journey or seek alternative
OL,22,Froutes.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
